            "text": "---\nname: text-diff\ndescription: Compare two text versions line by line and report kept, deleted, and added lines. Use for reviewing document edits when exact line content matters, including Chinese text, blank inputs, and repeated lines.\n---\n\n# Text diff\n\nUse the `text_diff` Tool via native `tool_search` when a user needs to compare two text versions. Pass the original as `oldText` and the revised version as `newText`. The Tool performs local, exact line comparison; it does not access external services, normalize whitespace, interpret intent, or assess correctness.\n\nResults are an ordered sequence of `保持` (kept), `删除` (deleted), and `新增` (added) lines. Matching is ordered; repeated identical lines are paired according to the selected shortest-edit alignment. Empty input is valid. A final newline does not create an additional phantom line, while interior blank lines are preserved as lines. Chinese is handled as ordinary Unicode text.\n"
